          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रूळ — rūḷ — \"a rail; a railway track\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आगगाडी रुळावरून घसरली. āggāḍī ruḷāvarūn ghasarlī. The train came off the rails."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before an ending the long ऊ shortens: रूळ (rūḷ), but रुळावर, on the rails."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रूळ (rūḷ) names one steel rail of a track, and in the plural the line itself; where the word comes from is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
