              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लोहमार्ग — lohmārga — \"a railway line\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हा लोहमार्ग डोंगरातून जातो. hā lohmārga ḍoṅgarātūn jāto. This railway line runs through the hills."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A formal word, common on signs and in the news; people say रेल्वे or गाडीचा रस्ता."
            }
          ]
        },
