          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लोहमार्ग (lohmārga) is built from two tatsama words, Sanskrit loha, \"iron\", and mārga, \"road, way\" (Monier-Williams): the iron road."
            }
          ]
