              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मालगाडी — mālgāḍī — \"a goods train\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रात्री एक लांब मालगाडी गेली. rātrī ek lāmb mālgāḍī gelī. A long goods train went past at night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It carries freight, not people; a passenger train is a प्रवासी गाडी."
            }
          ]
        },
