          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मालगाडी (mālgāḍī) is a Marathi compound of माल, \"goods\", a loan usually traced to Arabic māl, \"property, goods\", and गाडी, \"a cart, a train\" (CDIAL 4116)."
            }
          ]
        },
