              "text": "खडखडणे — khaḍkhaḍṇe — \"to rattle\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जुना डबा रुळावर खडखडत होता. junā ḍabā ruḷāvar khaḍkhaḍat hotā. The old coach was rattling on the rails."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो खडखडला, to khaḍkhaḍlā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An echo word made into a verb: खड खड is the noise itself."
            }
          ]
        },
