              "text": "खडखडणे (khaḍkhaḍṇe) is inherited and imitates its sound: CDIAL lists Marathi khaḍkhaḍṇẽ, \"to rattle\", under Sanskrit khaṭakhaṭāyate, \"crackles\" (CDIAL 3771)."
